<!-- Notification small icon: a monochrome (alpha-only) silhouette of the Magio C-spark.
     Android tints it white in the status bar / notification, so only the shape matters. The
     four-pointed star with its smaller companion star at the upper right is the Magio mark,
     drawn solid: at 24dp the old wireframe's thin edges were already close to the minimum
     stroke Android renders cleanly, and a filled silhouette stays crisp in the status bar. -->
