         y 168...856) mapped to the 24dp viewport at 0.029 units per SVG unit and centred on
         (12,12), which lands it at 1.66...22.34 horizontally and 2.02...21.98 vertically. -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF"
        android:pathData="M11.6346,2.024 C12.0986,8.172,15.4626,11.536,21.6106,12 C15.4626,12.464,12.0986,15.828,11.6346,21.976 C11.1706,15.828,7.8066,12.464,1.6586,12 C7.8066,11.536,11.1706,8.172,11.6346,2.024 Z" />
    <!-- Companion star, upper right: the same star scaled 0.3 and translated (624.4,142.4)
         in the SVG, baked here. -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF"
